  "name": "Lead Generation — Searlo + Gemini",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "85cbf2a5-b707-4809-9fc1-393b92b4b60c",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -4064,
        96
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 532,
        "height": 480,
        "content": "\n\n## Lead Generation — Searlo + Gemini\n\nAutomated B2B lead discovery pipeline that runs **every day \nat 09:00**.\n\n**Pipeline:**\n1. Gemini generates 5 targeted search queries\n2. Searlo SERP fetches 10 organic results per query\n3. Gemini qualifies & scores each lead (1–10)\n4. Qualified leads are appended to Google Sheets\n\n**Credentials:** Google Gemini (PaLM) · Searlo API Key · Google Sheets OAuth2"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "97503b8d-ee8e-4363-a657-3dbb601a6c8a",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -3920,
        752
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 0,
        "width": 316,
        "height": 284,
        "content": "## Trigger\nFires every day at **09:00**.\nKicks off the full lead generation pipeline."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d3d5b81d-6b41-4071-84b6-953c9c8b3b5f",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -3344,
        416
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 2,
        "width": 584,
        "height": 652,
        "content": "## Query Generation\nGemini creates **5 targeted B2B search queries** (SaaS, agencies, fintech, e-commerce).\n\nFalls back to hardcoded default queries if the response can't be parsed."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "59fb7a28-9e13-483a-bc05-95098a7483a6",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -2672,
        512
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 0,
        "width": 536,
        "height": 524,
        "content": "## Search & Discover\nCalls the **Searlo SERP API** with each query (limit 10, US/EN).\n\nExtracts **title, URL, snippet, and position** from every organic result."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d548cdd5-976a-46dd-9f0e-ae1835c42055",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -2080,
        464
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 2,
        "width": 944,
        "height": 652,
        "content": "\n\n\n## AI Qualification (Batch Loop)\nResults are processed **2 at a time** via Split in Batches.\n\nGemini scores each lead **1–10** and extracts company name, website, industry, location, and score rationale.\n\nLoop continues until all batches are processed."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "826b47db-c621-4dc4-bedd-30c99e542802",
      "name": "Sticky Note5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -1072,
        592
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 668,
        "height": 460,
        "content": "\n\n## Save to Sheets\nAppends each qualified lead as a new row to **Sheet1** of the *searlo_workflow* spreadsheet.\n\nColumns: company, website, description, industry, location, score, reason, query, timestamp."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "0150a170-9618-42d8-80d0-082d29846c00",
      "name": "Daily Schedule1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        -3824,
        896
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "9bcb8f5d-bb6a-43d8-bf5b-7325b273eea5",
      "name": "Generate Search Queries1",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "position": [
        -3248,
        656
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You are a B2B lead generation expert. Today is {{ $now.toFormat(\"yyyy-MM-dd\") }}. Generate 5 effective Google search queries to discover B2B companies that are potential leads (SaaS companies, marketing agencies, fintech, e-commerce tech startups). Queries should target contact pages, LinkedIn company pages, or \"about us\" pages.\n\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON array of query strings — no markdown, no explanation:\n[\"query 1\", \"query 2\", \"query 3\", \"query 4\", \"query 5\"]",
        "batching": {},
        "promptType": "define"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.9
    },
    {
      "id": "5d73ad24-d56b-4d91-823a-40af4d5fd5b9",
      "name": "Gemini (Query Gen)1",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "position": [
        -3184,
        864
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3
        },
        "modelName": "models/gemini-3.1-flash-lite"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "ce8gNxoCbH8JGaQZ",
          "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "a97d7cb1-9292-45a3-b9e9-235c0d3f8e9f",
      "name": "Parse Queries1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        -2896,
        656
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\nconst text = ($input.first().json.text || '').trim();\nconst cleaned = text.replace(/^```json\\s*/i, '').replace(/```\\s*$/i, '').trim();\nlet queries = [];\ntry {\n  queries = JSON.parse(cleaned);\n  if (!Array.isArray(queries)) queries = [cleaned];\n} catch (e) {\n  queries = [\n    \"SaaS software companies contact us site:linkedin.com\",\n    \"B2B marketing agencies contact page\",\n    \"e-commerce tech startups about us contact\",\n    \"fintech companies contact us site:linkedin.com\",\n    \"cloud software companies contact us\"\n  ];\n}\nreturn queries.map(q => ({ json: { query: String(q) } }));\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "0ad16f5d-3306-421a-b903-afac7c585594",
      "name": "Search Searlo SERP1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        -2592,
        752
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.searlo.tech/api/v1/search/web",
        "options": {},
        "sendQuery": true,
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpTemplatedCustomAuth",
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "q",
              "value": "={{ $json.query }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "limit",
              "value": "10"
            },
            {
              "name": "gl",
              "value": "us"
            },
            {
              "name": "hl",
              "value": "en"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpTemplatedCustomAuth": {
          "id": "0Ov4Xso9mQYt2p5X",
          "name": "Searlo API Key (Muhammad U)"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.5
    },
    {
      "id": "09bfe940-824c-4a73-b5b4-70f609ea94be",
      "name": "Extract Organic Results1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        -2368,
        752
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\nconst items = $input.all();\nconst output = [];\nfor (const item of items) {\n  const organic = item.json.organic || [];\n  const query = (item.json.searchParameters && item.json.searchParameters.q) || item.json.query || '';\n  for (const result of organic) {\n    output.push({\n      json: {\n        query,\n        title: result.title || '',\n        url: result.link || result.url || '',\n        snippet: result.snippet || '',\n        position: result.position || 0,\n      },\n    });\n  }\n}\nreturn output;\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "cc60510a-7692-4276-838a-79173bc2686d",
      "name": "Process in Batches1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "position": [
        -2080,
        880
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "batchSize": 2
      },
      "typeVersion": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "d985093e-35ce-482c-8ca6-a2a4be0a6000",
      "name": "Prepare Batch1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        -1872,
        816
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\nconst items = $input.all();\nconst results = items.map((item, i) => ({\n  index: i + 1,\n  query: item.json.query,\n  title: item.json.title,\n  url: item.json.url,\n  snippet: item.json.snippet,\n  position: item.json.position,\n}));\nreturn [{ json: { results: results, total: results.length } }];\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "a5d28f30-483e-4116-b032-89970cceb67e",
      "name": "Qualify All Leads1",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "position": [
        -1712,
        752
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You are a B2B lead qualification expert. Below are {{ $json.total }} Google search results. Analyze ALL of them and return a JSON array — one object per result.\n\nResults:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.results, null, 2) }}\n\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON array with no markdown or extra text. Each object must have exactly these fields:\n[\n  {\n    \"company_name\": \"company name from title or URL\",\n    \"website\": \"clean root domain URL (e.g. https://acme.com)\",\n    \"description\": \"one-sentence summary of what this company does\",\n    \"industry\": \"primary industry (e.g. SaaS, Fintech, E-commerce)\",\n    \"location\": \"city/country if mentioned, else Unknown\",\n    \"lead_score\": <integer 1-10 based on B2B lead quality>,\n    \"lead_score_reason\": \"brief reason for the score\",\n    \"source_query\": \"the search query that surfaced this result\"\n  }\n]",
        "batching": {},
        "promptType": "define"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.9
    },
    {
      "id": "53cba041-65a5-4117-97fb-bdbe8a906c99",
      "name": "Gemini (Qualifier)1",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "position": [
        -1680,
        960
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        },
        "modelName": "models/gemini-3.1-flash-lite"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "ce8gNxoCbH8JGaQZ",
          "name": "Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "90e3dded-1fda-4141-9f64-d2f29c2f46ec",
      "name": "Parse Lead Array1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        -1344,
        864
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\nlet text = ($input.first().json.text || '').trim();\ntext = text.replace(/^```json\\s*/i, '').replace(/```\\s*$/i, '').trim();\nlet leads = [];\ntry {\n  leads = JSON.parse(text);\n  if (!Array.isArray(leads)) leads = [leads];\n} catch (e) {\n  return [{ json: { parse_error: e.message, raw_output: text } }];\n}\nconst now = new Date().toISOString();\nreturn leads.map(function(lead) {\n  return {\n    json: {\n      company_name: lead.company_name || '',\n      website: lead.website || '',\n      description: lead.description || '',\n      industry: lead.industry || '',\n      location: lead.location || '',\n      lead_score: lead.lead_score || '',\n      lead_score_reason: lead.lead_score_reason || '',\n      source_query: lead.source_query || '',\n      discovered_at: now,\n    },\n  };\n});\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
